  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The bumbler’s ability to dodge around death is unbelievable, to the point that it seems that nothing can really kill them. At 16th level, the bumbler can use their skin of your teeth class feature to avoid being killed by effects that don’t deal hit point damage. This includes things like ability damage, death effects, and poisons. The bumbler is still reduced to 1 hit point, but ignores whatever effect would have killed them as though they had successfully saved against the effect. The bumbler must have a daily use of skin of your teeth remaining to use this ability.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bumbler#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
